{
  "description": "Development set (71 questions). Used while building the offline pipeline and to choose its abstention rule and thresholds. It has two parts: 22 short, keyword-style questions (ids d*/u*) written first, and 49 conversational questions (ids g*/a*) that were originally drafted as the golden set. The first run on those 49 showed that an abstention threshold chosen on keyword-style questions wrongly declined most conversational ones, so they were demoted to development data and a new golden set was written and frozen before the redesign (see eval/README.md). Reported results come from golden_set.json, which was not used for tuning.",
